{% comment %}
  Snippet: WW Product Supplement Facts Panel
  Renders directions and Supplement Facts panels dynamically from product metafields/metaobjects.
  Accepts: product

  ========================================================================================
  SHOPIFY ADMIN CUSTOM DATA CONFIGURATION GUIDE FOR SUPPLEMENT FACTS:
  ========================================================================================
  1. CREATE THE METAOBJECT (The row structure for each supplement fact entry):
     - Go to: Settings > Custom data > Metaobjects > Add definition.
     - Name: "Supplement Fact Row" (Shopify will automatically assign key: "supplement_fact_row").
     - Add these 3 Fields:
       * Field 1: Single line text -> Name: "Name" (Key: "name")
       * Field 2: Single line text -> Name: "Amount" (Key: "amount")
       * Field 3: Single line text -> Name: "Daily Value" (Key: "daily_value")

  2. CREATE THE PRODUCT METAFIELDS:
     - Go to: Settings > Custom data > Products > Add definition.
     
     a. Directions & Caution (Rich Text):
        - Name: "Directions & Caution"
        - Namespace and key: "custom.directions"
        
     c. Serving Size (Single line text):
        - Name: "Serving Size"
        - Namespace and key: "custom.serving_size"
        
     d. Servings (Single line text):
        - Name: "Servings"
        - Namespace and key: "custom.servings"
        
     e. Other Ingredients (Rich Text):
        - Name: "Other Ingredients"
        - Namespace and key: "custom.other_ingredients"
        
     f. Supplement Facts List (The list of rows):
        - Name: "Supplement Facts List"
        - Namespace and key: "custom.supplement_facts_list"
        - Type: Select "Metaobject", and select "List of entries" (repeater).
        - Reference: Select your "Supplement Fact Row" metaobject definition.
        
  3. ADD DATA TO PRODUCTS:
     - Go to any Product page in your Admin, scroll to the bottom Metafields section,
       fill in directions/caution/metadata, and link entries in your "Supplement Facts List" repeater!
  ========================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign directions_mf = product.metafields.custom.directions -%}

{%- if directions_mf != blank -%}
  <div class="ww-detail-lede ww-rich-text" style="margin:0 0 20px">
    {{ directions_mf | metafield_tag }}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign facts_html = product.metafields.custom.supplement_facts_html.value | default: product.metafields.custom.supplement_facts.value | default: product.metafields.custom.product_information.value | default: product.metafields.custom.product_information -%}
{%- assign serving_size = product.metafields.custom.serving_size.value | default: product.metafields.custom.serving_size -%}
{%- assign servings_per = product.metafields.custom.servings.value | default: product.metafields.custom.servings -%}
{%- assign facts_list = product.metafields.custom.supplement_facts_list.value -%}
{%- assign other_ingredients_mf = product.metafields.custom.other_ingredients -%}

{%- if facts_html != blank -%}
  {{ facts_html }}
{%- elsif serving_size != blank or facts_list != blank -%}
  <div class="ww-sf-panel">
    <h4 class="ww-sf-h">Supplement Facts Panel</h4>
    <div class="ww-sf">
      {%- if serving_size != blank or servings_per != blank -%}
        <div class="ww-sf-meta">
          {%- if serving_size != blank -%}Serving size: {{ serving_size }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if servings_per != blank -%}&nbsp;·&nbsp; Servings per container: {{ servings_per }}{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      
      <div class="ww-sf-row ww-sf-row--h">
        <span>&nbsp;</span>
        <span>Amount per serving</span>
        <span>% DV</span>
      </div>
      
      {%- for item in facts_list -%}
        <div class="ww-sf-row">
          <span>{{ item.name | default: item.title | escape }}</span>
          <span>{{ item.amount | default: item.dosage | escape }}</span>
          <span>{{ item.daily_value | default: item.dv | default: '†' | escape }}</span>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
      
      {%- if other_ingredients_mf != blank -%}
        <div class="ww-sf-note ww-rich-text" style="margin-top: 8px;">
          {{ other_ingredients_mf | metafield_tag }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
